  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The scale of the proposed works, the visual impact of the proposed works on the streetscene, and the poor design quality of the proposed works, particularly the overly dominant central window above the entrance door, would be unduly obtrusive and incongruous and would undermine the established character and appearance of the existing dwellinghouse and would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the West Drive and Bellfield Avenue Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), policies GR1 and HE1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
